### Account Service health
GET http://localhost:8081/health

### Account Service healthcheck alias
GET http://localhost:8081/healthcheck

### Apply credit transaction
POST http://localhost:8081/accounts/acct-123/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 9b63f0d4-0f49-4f85-9447-fd45a0c5b3c2

{
  "eventId": "9b63f0d4-0f49-4f85-9447-fd45a0c5b3c2",
  "type": "CREDIT",
  "amount": 150.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "eventTimestamp": "2026-05-15T14:02:11Z",
  "metadata": {
    "source": "event-gateway"
  }
}

### Get balance
GET http://localhost:8081/accounts/acct-123/balance

